sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant A as Provider Adapter
  participant R as Raw Store
  participant N as Normalizer
  participant M as Matching/Merge
  participant C as Canonical Store
  participant P as Publication

  S->>O: request sync
  O->>O: acquire lock
  O->>A: fetch page
  A-->>O: raw response
  O->>R: persist raw observation
  O->>N: normalize
  N-->>O: normalized observations
  O->>M: match and merge
  M->>C: persist decisions
  O->>P: publish if changed
  O->>O: release lock and finalize
